 lines += ['', f"Holding every other county at its explicit unchanged2024Senate preference and volume, **Hennepin alone ties statewide at{100*float(he['selected_required_raw_share']):.6f}%DFLpair share**. Its own baseline is{100*float(he['baseline_share']):.6f}%;+1share point there is worth{float(he['plus1_share_pp_net_gain']):,.2f}net votes. All other county/municipal/native selected-unit requirements are saved, retaining raw below0/already-secured, above1/impossible, boundary and zero-pool outcomes. The selected-only formula is q_i=[T_i+gT−Σ_other T_j(2q_j−1)]/(2T_i), for T_i>0. All nonselected units stay in each solve; users can change the explicit other-unit shift with the CLI. Preference gains in different units trade off by net votes.", '', '## Offline conditional live remainder','', 'The calculator accepts an explicit complete set of counted candidate totals and stated remaining pools; it forecasts only the remainder. It refuses unknown/negative pools and inconsistent candidate coverage. Pair and all-candidate final denominators differ. With counted lead L, counted pair C and remaining pair U, an A+1final-pair-margin target needs **q=[U+.01*(C+U)−L]/(2U)**, not the share that merely wins the remaining batch by1point. Selected-unit solving holds all counted votes and every other declared remaining pool/preference fixed. No assumed remainder is inferred from precinct reporting percentages or historical turnout.','', '[Eleven synthetic inputs](data/baselines/live-scenarios-input.json) and [computed outputs](data/baselines/live-scenarios-output.json) exercise unknown/no-pool/negative/impossible/secured cases, clipping, named-other plurality risk and final denominators. [Bounded-solver cases](data/baselines/bounded-solver-cases.json) retain unknown preference, negative weights, no positive pool and infeasible targets. These are arithmetic checks, not a calibrated Needle, election call, live collector or forecast distribution. Every other unit must be supplied explicitly or represented by a clearly scoped residual aggregate.','', '```sh','PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 senate/2026/minnesota/data/baselines/reproduce.py','PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 senate/2026/minnesota/data/baselines/calculator.py --contest 2024-senate --level county --unit MN:county:27053 --others-shift-pp 0','PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 senate/2026/minnesota/data/baselines/calculator.py --live senate/2026/minnesota/data/baselines/live-scenarios-input.json --case final-denominator-cushion','```','', 'The build is offline from original retained source bytes. `reproduce.py --acquire` verifies retained acquisition references and fetches missing authority captures; `acquire.py --refresh` explicitly refreshes owned authority captures. Changed source versions require review. [Validation](data/baselines/validation.json) checks source/candidate/native balances, denominators and weights, full orders/integer80, bounded targets/selected-unit requirements, live invariants, named-WI scope, relative links and every asset bound. [Asset manifest](data/baselines/asset-manifest.json) lists owned paths/hashes/bytes and original source references.','', '## Material limits for handoff','', 'The complete verified historical scope is87counties and4,103/4,103/4,110source native rows, with all required candidates/method and registration controls, plus the2020named-writein county appendix.2022/2024full named-writein annexes, blank/under/over counts, native named-WI allocations and candidate-by-method returns remain unavailable. No independent county2022/2024canvassPDF was recovered; current official state workbook totals and statewide publications agree, while2020has an additional independently parsed countyPDF control.','', 'The official2026city sample PDFs establish the four printed general-ballot candidates; actual live Senate candidate/contest IDs, full eligible write-in publication, all current native identities and approved historical-to-current crosswalk remain gates for live use. Current MPR selectsAugustprimary/AP and the state media route can return HTTP200challengeHTML; [news evidence](local-news-results.md) and [collection strategy](live-polling-strategy.md) are read-only preparation, not accepted November result feeds. No known live cadence, implemented collector, calibrated probability,2026turnout forecast, or approved boundary is claimed. Historical method warnings, observed source discrepancies, generic/named scopes and transport limitations remain visible.']
